graph LR
    OGXOp["ogx-k8s-operator<br/>(OGXServer operator + ogx-module)"]

    %% External Dependencies
    OGXOp -->|operator framework| CR["controller-runtime v0.23.3"]
    OGXOp -->|k8s clients| ClientGo["client-go / api v0.35.2"]
    OGXOp -->|in-process rendering| Kustomize["kustomize api/kyaml v0.21.0"]
    OGXOp -->|TLS profiles| OCPApi["openshift/api +<br/>controller-runtime-common"]
    OGXOp -->|image ref parsing| GCR["go-containerregistry v0.22.1"]
    OGXOp -->|monitoring types| PromOpLib["prometheus-operator apis v0.82.0"]
    OGXOp -->|module config| Viper["spf13/viper v1.21.0"]
    OGXOp -.->|optional CRDs| PromCRDs["Prometheus Operator CRDs"]

    %% Internal Platform Dependencies
    PlatformOp["opendatahub-operator /<br/>rhods-operator"] -->|creates OGX CR,<br/>deploys ogx-module| OGXOp
    OGXOp -->|deploy/render/GC| PlatUtils["odh-platform-utilities"]
    OGXOp -->|manages workload,<br/>HTTP status polling| OGXServer["OGX server<br/>odh-ogx-core / distribution 1.4.1"]
    OGXOp -->|NetworkPolicy peer,<br/>readiness, migration target| Praxis["Praxis gateway"]
    OGXOp -->|serving certs,<br/>caBundle injection| ServiceCA["OpenShift service-ca"]
    OGXOp -->|TLS profile watch| APIServerCfg["OpenShift APIServer config"]
    OGXOp -->|CA trust mount| TrustedCA["odh-trusted-ca-bundle"]
    OGXOp -->|ServiceMonitor/<br/>PrometheusRule| Monitoring["platform monitoring"]

    %% External Services
    OGXOp -->|reconciliation 6443/TCP| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    OGXOp -->|OCI labels 443/80| Registry["Container registries"]
    OGXServer -->|inference / storage| Backends["Providers / SQL / KV"]

    %% Legacy
    OGXOp -.->|adopts resources| LSD["LlamaStackDistribution<br/>(legacy)"]

    style OGXOp fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,stroke-width:4px
    style CR fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style ClientGo fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style Kustomize fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style OCPApi fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style GCR fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style PromOpLib fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style Viper fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style PromCRDs fill:#999,stroke:#333
    style PlatformOp fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style PlatUtils fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style OGXServer fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style Praxis fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style ServiceCA fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style APIServerCfg fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style TrustedCA fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style Monitoring fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style K8sAPI fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333
    style Registry fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333
    style Backends fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333
    style LSD fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
